===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{lb|en|rare}} [[clothing|Clothing]]; [[clothes]].
# Any hard [[coating]], [[bonded]] onto the outside of something to add [[protection]], such as the [[plastic]] [[sheath]] around an [[optical fibre]].
# {{lb|en|construction}} A [[weatherproof]], [[insulating]] or [[decorative]] [[covering]] fixed to the outside of a [[building]] (called [[siding]] in the US).

